# The W2A builds that enter the root after their own builds and that no other
# targets file names: the torch-chain extras, vLLM, and the vLLM runtime lanes
# that no sync DB carries. Resolve this file together with
# torch-chain.targets, model-closure.targets and vllm-build.targets, once all
# of them are in ashp-w2a, to lock the whole assembled root:
#   c_buildroot.py resolve --targets-file tools/buildroot/torch-chain.targets \
#     --targets-file tools/buildroot/model-closure.targets \
#     --targets-file tools/buildroot/vllm-build.targets \
#     --targets-file tools/buildroot/w2a-assembled.targets ...
# That lock is the dependency proof for these packages too, vLLM's depends
# included. Leave this file out to resolve a root that can build them.
python-torchvision-rocm-gfx1151
python-torchao-rocm-gfx1151
python-torch-migraphx-gfx1151
python-flash-attn-rocm-gfx1151
python-apache-tvm-ffi-gfx1151
python-xgrammar-gfx1151
python-einops-gfx1151
python-httptools-gfx1151
python-msgspec-gfx1151
python-openai-harmony-gfx1151
python-prometheus-fastapi-instrumentator-gfx1151
python-py-cpuinfo-gfx1151
python-pybase64-gfx1151
python-uvloop-gfx1151
python-vllm-rocm-gfx1151
